# Platform console — Supabase-only (DL-038), no local backend, no tenant
# scoping (this app is cross-tenant, unlike every other client in this repo).
#
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY is the ANON key, not the service-role key — it is
# designed to be public/embedded in a client bundle. Never put
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY in this app: privileged console operations
# (issuing a TerminalActivationToken, resolving an activation_request,
# generating a billing invoice) go through a service-role-holding Edge
# Function (console-issue-terminal-activation-token,
# console-resolve-activation-request, console-generate-billing-invoice) —
# see the console schema migration's header comment for why that's required
# rather than an RLS policy on this client's own session.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=""
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=""
